  "work is blocked or something broke that the user must weigh in on. Direction matters: the USER's own question "
  "in the record is the OPPOSITE case — a reply that ANSWERS the user's question has DELIVERED the asked-for "
  "thing, which is DONE, not DECISION; only what the assistant still needs FROM the user counts), "
  "ACTION (the work is built but requires the user to physically DO something outside the chat for it to take "
